    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a> by converting the given <a href=\"../domain/Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> into a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.SliceMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel.SliceMetadata</code></a> instance and\nusing the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a> to turn elements of the <a href=\"../domain/Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> into resources. Will add pagination links\nbased on the given the self link.",
      "translation": "通过给定的<a href=\"../domain/Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>将其转换为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.SliceMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel.SliceMetadata</code></a>实例，并创建一个新的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a>，同时使用给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a>将<a href=\"../domain/Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>中的元素转换为资源。将根据给定的自身链接添加分页链接。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a> by converting the given <a href=\"../domain/Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> into a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.SliceMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel.SliceMetadata</code></a> instance and\nwrapping the contained elements into * <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a> instances.",
      "translation": "通过给定的 <a href=\"../domain/Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> 将其转换为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.SliceMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel.SliceMetadata</code></a> 实例，并创建一个新的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a>，同时将其包含的元素包装为多个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a> 实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a> by converting the given <a href=\"../domain/Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> into a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.SliceMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel.SliceMetadata</code></a> instance and\nwrapping the contained elements into * <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a> instances. Will add pagination links based on the given\nself link.",
      "translation": "通过给定的 <a href=\"../domain/Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> 将其转换为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.SliceMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel.SliceMetadata</code></a> 实例，并创建一个新的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a>，同时将其中包含的元素包装为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a> 实例。该方法会根据给定的自链接添加分页链接。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/server/RepresentationModelAssembler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas.server\"><code>RepresentationModelAssembler</code></a> to easily convert <a href=\"../domain/Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> instances into <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/server/RepresentationModelAssembler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas.server\"><code>RepresentationModelAssembler</code></a> 可轻松将 <a href=\"../domain/Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> 实例转换为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"SlicedResourcesAssembler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>SlicedResourcesAssembler</code></a> using the given <a href=\"PageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>PageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> and\nbase URI. If the former is null, a default one will be created. If the latter is null, calls\nto <a href=\"#toModel(org.springframework.data.domain.Slice)\"><code>toModel(Slice)</code></a> will use the current request's URI to build the relevant previous and next links.",
      "translation": "使用给定的<a href=\"PageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>PageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a>和基础 URI 创建一个新的<a href=\"SlicedResourcesAssembler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>SlicedResourcesAssembler</code></a>。如果前者为 null，则创建一个默认实例；如果后者为 null，则调用<a href=\"#toModel(org.springframework.data.domain.Slice)\"><code>toModel(Slice)</code></a>时将使用当前请求的 URI 来构建相关的上一页和下一页链接。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configures whether to always add <code>first</code> links to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a> * created. Defaults to\nfalse which means that <code>first</code> links onlys appear in conjunction with <code>prev</code> and\n<code>next</code> links.",
      "translation": "配置是否始终为创建的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a>添加<code>first</code>链接。默认值为false，这意味着<code>first</code>链接仅在同时存在<code>prev</code>和<code>next</code>链接时才会出现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"SlicedResourcesAssembler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>SlicedResourcesAssembler</code></a> using the given <a href=\"PageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>PageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> and\nbase URI.",
      "translation": "使用给定的<a href=\"PageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>PageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a>和基础 URI 创建一个新的<a href=\"SlicedResourcesAssembler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>SlicedResourcesAssembler</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
