      "translation": "配置是否始终为创建的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a> * 添加 <code>first</code> 链接。",
      "count": 1
